{"game":"Cookie Clicker","source":"custom","apworld":"cookieclicker.apworld","world_version":null,"groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"advancement_goal","name":"Achievement Goal","kind":"range","doc":"Achievement Goal\n100 is pretty easy, 300 is average and 500 is very hard.\nAchievement count include shadow achievements","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":643,"default":100,"doc_fr":"Objectif atteint\n100 est assez facile, 300 est moyenne et 500 est très difficile.\nLe nombre de réalisations comprend les réalisations parallèles"},{"key":"traps_percentage","name":"Traps Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Traps Percentage","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":50},{"key":"enable_hints","name":"Enable Auto Hints","kind":"toggle","doc":"Enable revealing the items in adjacent locations when completing an achievement","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"production_multiplier","name":"Production Multiplier (power of ten)","kind":"range","doc":"Production multiplier, as a power of ten\n0 (x1): Vanilla\n1/2 (x10/x100): Slightly faster early game\n3 (x1000): Suitable for sync (completion in several hours)\n4 (x10.000): Suitable for sync (completion in about 1 hour)\n5 (x100.000): You can stop now.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":5,"default":0},{"key":"lump_multiplier","name":"Lump Multiplier","kind":"range","doc":"Lump multiplier","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":10,"default":1},{"key":"enable_progressive_buildings","name":"Synergy as Progressive Buildings","kind":"toggle","doc":"When enabled, this option makes Synergy upgrades behave like an Unlock Building item.\nThis mean you get 3x Unlock Building instead of 1x, and subsequent unlocks will\nturn into a synergy upgrade instead.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"plentiful_buildings","name":"Plentiful buildings","kind":"range","doc":"Add additional copies of the Buildings into the item pool, allowing you to more easily find and unlock them\nStacks with Progressive Buildings","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":5,"default":1,"doc_fr":"Ajoutez des copies supplémentaires des bâtiments dans la piscine de l'article, vous permettant de les trouver et de les débloquer plus facilement."}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"exclude_locations","name":"Excluded Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an important item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an important item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément important.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément important.</p>\n"},{"key":"priority_locations","name":"Priority Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.","weighte